{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人蕭正楠（Edwin）、曹永廉與馬國明日前在廣州舉行《三生有幸巡迴演唱會》，3人繼續大唱劇集串燒歌，惹來全場大合唱，又扭腰獻唱草蜢歌曲《失戀》炒熱氣氛，有網民搞笑留言：「慢點扭，不要閃到腰！</p><p>」&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;3</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T16:17:12.517713+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T16:01:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T16:10:22.609990+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T16:10:22.609990+00:00","content_hash":"cf2309e5a0cdc9996e4beb783ab38ca59a70777e9f0d773a2dbe822cfd2d23f6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}